/* MistyBox legal pages (generated 2026-11-25 from rocketdreams-data/docs/mistybox-legal/*.md; draft pending counsel review) */
window.MB_LEGAL={"how-it-works": {"t": "How It Works", "h": "<p>MistyBox is an online store for authentic luxury watches and other\npremium goods, sold through a mystery-box experience. You choose a box,\nreveal what is inside, and then decide what to do with your item.\n<strong>You always receive full value for every box you\nopen.</strong></p>\n<h2 id=\"create-your-account\">1. Create your account</h2>\n<p>Sign in with Apple, Google or Facebook and verify your email address.\nYou must be at least 18, or the age of majority where you live if that\nis higher. Each person may hold only one account. Before your first\ndeposit we ask you to complete a quick age check.</p>\n<h2 id=\"add-funds\">2. Add funds</h2>\n<p>Link a debit or credit card and add funds to your balance in U.S.\ndollars. Your balance is used to open boxes.</p>\n<h2 id=\"choose-a-box\">3. Choose a box</h2>\n<p>Every box shows its price up front. Before you open it you can\nsee:</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>every item</strong> the box can contain,</li>\n<li><strong>the fair market value</strong> of each item, and</li>\n<li><strong>the probability (odds)</strong> of receiving each item.</li>\n</ul>\n<p>Items are grouped into rarity tiers of similar value. Rarer,\nhigher-value items have lower odds, and more common items have higher\nodds. Fair market values come from independent third-party retailers and\nare updated automatically.</p>\n<h2 id=\"reveal-your-item\">4. Reveal your item</h2>\n<p>When you open a box, the result is locked in by our <strong>Provably\nFair</strong> system before anything appears on screen. The reveal\nanimation is for display only and does not affect the result. You can\nskip it at any time.</p>\n<p>Every box contains one of the items shown. <strong>There are no empty\nboxes.</strong></p>\n<h2 id=\"the-full-value-guarantee\">5. The full-value guarantee</h2>\n<p>If the item you reveal has a fair market value <strong>lower than the\nprice you paid</strong> for the box, we immediately add <strong>Gift\nCoins</strong> to your account for the difference.</p>\n<blockquote>\n<p><strong>Example:</strong> You open a $100 box and reveal a watch\nvalued at $60. You receive the watch <strong>plus 40 Gift\nCoins</strong>, for a total value of $100.</p>\n</blockquote>\n<p>If your item is worth the box price or more, you simply keep the\nitem.</p>\n<p>Gift Coins are loyalty rewards. One Gift Coin equals $1.00 of value\nin the <strong>MistyBox Store</strong>, where you can buy MistyBox\nmerchandise, branded watches and other products. Gift Coins cannot be\nbought, used to open boxes, transferred, or exchanged for cash or\ncryptocurrency. See the <a href=\"terms-of-service\">Terms of Service</a>\nfor details.</p>\n<h2 id=\"decide-what-to-do-with-your-item\">6. Decide what to do with your\nitem</h2>\n<p>After the reveal, your item goes to your <strong>Vault</strong>.\nWithin <strong>7 days</strong> you can:</p>\n<table>\n<colgroup>\n<col style=\"width: 50%\" />\n<col style=\"width: 50%\" />\n</colgroup>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>Option</th>\n<th>What happens</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>Ship it</strong></td>\n<td>Add a shipping address. We ship the item, insured, within 14\nbusiness days. Shipping fees are shown before you confirm.</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>Sell it back</strong></td>\n<td>We buy the item back and immediately credit your balance with\n<strong>90%</strong> of the fair market value shown when you opened the\nbox. The remaining 10% is a processing fee.</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>Keep it in your Vault</strong></td>\n<td>Your item stays in your Vault for up to 7 days (168 hours). We send\nyou reminders before the deadline. If you take no action, the item is\n<strong>automatically sold back</strong> on the same 90% terms.</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<h2 id=\"verify-fairness\">7. Verify fairness</h2>\n<p>After every opening you can view the client seed, server seed hash,\nnonce and, once the purchase is complete, the unhashed server seed. Our\nverification tool lets you check any result yourself. <a\nhref=\"fairness\">Learn more about values, probabilities and Provably\nFair</a>.</p>\n<h2 id=\"shop-responsibly\">8. Shop responsibly</h2>\n<p>You can set purchase limits, take a break or exclude yourself from\nMistyBox at any time from your account settings or by contacting <a\nhref=\"support\">Support</a>. See <a\nhref=\"responsible-purchasing\">Responsible Purchasing</a>.</p>\n<hr />\n<p>MistyBox is not available in every state. See <a\nhref=\"terms-of-service#eligibility\">Who can use MistyBox</a>.</p>\n"}, "terms-of-service": {"t": "Terms of Service", "h": "<p><em>Last updated: November 25, 2026</em></p>\n<p>These Terms of Service (“<strong>Terms</strong>”) are an agreement\nbetween you and <strong>Rocket Dreams Inc.</strong>, 39555 Orchard Hill\nPlace, STE 600, Novi, MI 48375, USA (“<strong>Rocket Dreams</strong>”,\n“<strong>we</strong>”, “<strong>us</strong>”). They govern your use of\nMistyBox, including the website at www.mistybox.com, our iOS and Android\napps, and related services (together, the\n“<strong>Platform</strong>”).</p>\n<p><strong>Please read these Terms carefully. Section 20 requires that\nmost disputes be resolved by binding individual arbitration and waives\nclass actions and jury trials, unless you opt out as explained\nthere.</strong> By creating an account or using the Platform, you agree\nto these Terms and to the following policies, which form part of these\nTerms: our <a href=\"privacy-policy\">Privacy Policy</a>, <a\nhref=\"cookie-policy\">Cookie Policy</a>, <a\nhref=\"refunds-sell-back\">Refunds &amp; Sell-back</a>, <a\nhref=\"shipping-delivery\">Shipping &amp; Delivery</a>, <a\nhref=\"fairness\">Item Values, Probabilities &amp; Provably Fair</a> and\n<a href=\"responsible-purchasing\">Responsible Purchasing</a>\npolicies.</p>\n<h2 id=\"what-mistybox-is\">1. What MistyBox is</h2>\n<p>MistyBox is an ecommerce platform. You buy the right to open a\ndigital “mystery box” and receive a <strong>physical item</strong> from\nthat box, such as a luxury watch. Each box displays, before\npurchase:</p>\n<ul>\n<li>its price,</li>\n<li>every item it can contain,</li>\n<li>each item’s fair market value, and</li>\n<li>the probability (odds) of receiving each item.</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>Every box always contains one of the displayed items. No box\nis ever empty.</strong> If the item you receive is worth less than the\nprice you paid, you also receive Gift Coins for the difference (section\n7). This means you always receive a total value <strong>at least equal\nto the price paid</strong> for the box.</p>\n<h2 id=\"eligibility\">2. Eligibility</h2>\n<p>To use the Platform you must:</p>\n<ol type=\"1\">\n<li>be at least <strong>18 years old</strong>, or the age of majority\nwhere you live if that is higher;</li>\n<li>be physically located in a state where MistyBox is available when\nyou deposit or open a box;</li>\n<li>have the legal capacity to enter into these Terms; and</li>\n<li>not have been previously suspended or excluded from the\nPlatform.</li>\n</ol>\n<p><strong>Restricted states.</strong> MistyBox is not available to\nusers located in <strong>Michigan, Minnesota, Montana, Nevada or\nWashington</strong>, or outside the United States. We may add or remove\nrestricted locations at any time. We verify your location using\ngeolocation technology. You must not use VPNs, proxies, location\nspoofing or other means to hide your location. If you do, we may close\nyour account and withhold amounts obtained in breach of this\nsection.</p>\n<h2 id=\"your-account\">3. Your account</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>You create an account using a supported social sign-in (Apple,\nGoogle or Facebook) and must <strong>verify your email\naddress</strong>.</li>\n<li><strong>One account per person.</strong> Duplicate, shared or\nthird-party accounts are not allowed.</li>\n<li>You must complete an <strong>age verification</strong> check before\nyour first deposit. We may request proof of age, identity, address or\nsource of funds <strong>at any time</strong>.</li>\n<li>You are responsible for keeping your login secure and for all\nactivity on your account. Tell us immediately at support@mistybox.com if\nyou suspect unauthorized access.</li>\n<li>The information you give us must be accurate and kept up to\ndate.</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"deposits-and-payments\">4. Deposits and payments</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>To open a box, you must link a debit or credit card and fund your\naccount balance. Deposits are in <strong>U.S. dollars</strong> and held\nas your account balance.</li>\n<li>Your balance is <strong>not a bank account</strong>, does not earn\ninterest, and is not insured by the FDIC.</li>\n<li>Payments are processed by third-party payment service providers. We\nrely on your card issuer’s and payment provider’s identity screening up\nto the thresholds in our anti-money-laundering (“<strong>AML</strong>”)\npolicy. Above those thresholds, we may carry out our own identity\n(“<strong>KYC</strong>”) and AML checks on withdrawals and\nshipments.</li>\n<li>You may only use payment methods that belong to you.</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"opening-boxes\">5. Opening boxes</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Boxes are currently offered at five price points: <strong>Heritage\n($50), Icon ($100), Masterpiece ($250), Legacy ($500) and The Crown\n($1,000)</strong>. We may add, remove or reprice boxes; the price is\nalways clearly displayed before you confirm.</li>\n<li>You may open any box for which you have enough balance.</li>\n<li>Items in each box are grouped into <strong>rarity tiers</strong> of\nsimilar value: <strong>Common, Uncommon, Rare, Epic and\nLegendary</strong>. When you open a box, the odds first determine the\ntier, and then a specific item within that tier is chosen at random.\nHigher-value tiers generally have lower odds.</li>\n<li><strong>Fair market value.</strong> Item values are taken from\nindependent third-party retail websites. We record the listed price and\nsource and update values automatically. The value shown at the moment\nyou open the box is the value used for Gift Coins, Sell-back and credits\nfor unavailable items.</li>\n<li>A box opening is <strong>final once confirmed</strong> and cannot be\ncancelled or reversed.</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"provably-fair\">6. Provably Fair</h2>\n<p>See also <a href=\"fairness\">Item Values, Probabilities &amp; Provably\nFair</a>.</p>\n<p>Results are generated by a cryptographic <strong>Provably\nFair</strong> system that is random, unbiased and independently\nverifiable. Each result is <strong>locked in before anything is shown on\nscreen</strong>. The opening animation is for display only and has no\neffect on the outcome, and you can skip it.</p>\n<p>After each opening we provide the <strong>client seed, server seed\nhash and nonce</strong>, and, after the purchase, the <strong>unhashed\nserver seed</strong>. This information is available in the app straight\nafter the opening and on demand, together with a tool to verify the\nresult.</p>\n<h2 id=\"gift-coins\">7. Gift Coins</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>What they are.</strong> Gift Coins are a\n<strong>non-redeemable loyalty reward</strong>. If you receive an item\nwhose fair market value is lower than the price you paid to open the\nbox, we immediately credit Gift Coins equal to the difference.\n<strong>One Gift Coin is equivalent to US $1.00</strong> in the MistyBox\nStore. <em>Example: you open a $100 box and receive an item valued at\n$60. You receive the item plus 40 Gift Coins, for a total value of\n$100.</em></li>\n<li><strong>How to use them.</strong> Gift Coins can be spent only on\nproducts and services offered in the <strong>MistyBox Store</strong>,\nsuch as MistyBox-branded and other merchandise (including branded\nwatches) and, where available, Gold Coin (“<strong>GC</strong>”)\npackages for Rocket Dreams’ separate social sweepstakes products. We may\nadd other uses in the future, such as enhanced features.</li>\n<li><strong>GC packages by location.</strong> GC packages are shown and\navailable only to eligible users in jurisdictions where they are\npermitted (for example, they are never available to users located in New\nYork). This is enforced automatically by our systems, and use of GC is\ngoverned by the terms of the relevant sweepstakes product.</li>\n<li><strong>Restrictions.</strong> Gift Coins <strong>cannot</strong> be\npurchased, used to buy or open boxes, transferred, gifted, sold,\nwithdrawn, or converted to cash, cryptocurrency or any other real-world\ncurrency. They have no cash value and are not your property.</li>\n<li><strong>Store purchases</strong> made with Gift Coins are final, are\nnot eligible for Sell-back, and any approved return is credited back in\nGift Coins.</li>\n<li><strong>Expiry.</strong> Gift Coins <strong>do not expire for at\nleast 12 months</strong>. Gift Coins expire if your account has no box\nopenings, deposits or Store purchases for <strong>12 consecutive\nmonths</strong>. We will email you at least 30 days before they\nexpire.</li>\n<li>No Gift Coins are awarded for promotional bonus boxes.</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"your-item-ship-sell-back-or-vault\">8. Your item: Ship, Sell-back\nor Vault</h2>\n<p>After a reveal, your item is held in your <strong>Vault</strong> and\nyou may choose to:</p>\n<p><strong>(a) Ship it.</strong> Provide a shipping address and pay the\nreasonable shipping fee shown before you confirm. Shipping fees are\nbased on our shipping costs. Items ship within <strong>14 business\ndays</strong>. See <a href=\"shipping-delivery\">Shipping &amp;\nDelivery</a>.</p>\n<p><strong>(b) Sell it back (“Sell-back”).</strong> We buy the item back\nand credit your balance with <strong>90% of the item’s fair market\nvalue</strong> as displayed when you opened the box. <strong>The\nremaining 10% is retained by us as a processing fee.</strong> Sell-back\napplies to the physical item only. Gift Coins credited at the reveal are\nnever bought back, refunded or reversed.</p>\n<p><strong>(c) Hold it in your Vault.</strong> Your item stays in your\nVault for <strong>7 days (168 hours)</strong>. We send you in-app\nreminders before the deadline. <strong>If you have not chosen to ship or\nsell the item by the end of the 7 days, it is automatically sold back to\nus</strong> on the Sell-back terms above, and the amount is credited to\nyour balance.</p>\n<h2 id=\"refunds-and-withdrawals\">9. Refunds and withdrawals</h2>\n<p>Full details are in our <a href=\"refunds-sell-back\">Refunds &amp;\nSell-back</a> policy. In summary:</p>\n<ul>\n<li>If you have deposited but <strong>not opened any box</strong>, you\nmay request a refund of your deposit to the original payment\nmethod.</li>\n<li><strong>Once you have opened a box, unspent deposit funds cannot be\nwithdrawn.</strong> You may withdraw Sell-back proceeds and any amount\ncredited because a claimed item could not be supplied.</li>\n<li>Withdrawals are paid to your original payment method by default. A\ndifferent payment method is subject to KYC and AML checks through our\nverification provider, Sumsub.</li>\n<li>Refunds and withdrawals above our AML thresholds are subject to KYC\nand AML checks. <strong>We may freeze funds pending review</strong>\nwhere we suspect fraud, abuse or a breach of these Terms.</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"promotions\">10. Promotions</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>First-deposit offer.</strong> On your first deposit of at\nleast <strong>$50</strong> (the price of the lowest-priced box), you may\nreceive either <strong>(i) one bonus box of the lowest tier</strong> or\n<strong>(ii) promotional account credit</strong>, as described in the\noffer.</li>\n<li>A bonus box item can be shipped, sold back or held in your Vault\nlike any other item. However, <strong>no Gift Coins are awarded</strong>\nfor a bonus box.</li>\n<li>You may receive <strong>no more than one bonus box</strong>,\nregardless of the amount deposited.</li>\n<li><strong>You may not withdraw Sell-back proceeds until you have\nopened at least one box using your deposited funds.</strong></li>\n<li>Promotional account credit can only be used to open boxes. It cannot\nbe withdrawn or redeemed for cash.</li>\n<li>We may offer other promotions, such as daily login rewards and\noccasional giveaways, each subject to its own terms. If a promotion’s\nterms conflict with these Terms, the promotion’s terms apply to that\npromotion. We may withdraw promotional value obtained through abuse,\nmultiple accounts or a breach of these Terms.</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"inventory-and-third-party-vendors\">11. Inventory and third-party\nvendors</h2>\n<p>We generally own our inventory. In some cases, trusted third-party\nvendors supply items, and may ship them directly to you. Their inventory\nis synced to the Platform. Each vendor is responsible for the quality\nand authenticity of the items it supplies. If a claimed item is\nunavailable or cannot be shipped within 14 business days, we return it\nto inventory and credit your balance with <strong>100% of its fair\nmarket value</strong>. You may withdraw this amount or use it on the\nPlatform.</p>\n<h2 id=\"responsible-purchasing\">12. Responsible purchasing</h2>\n<p>We want MistyBox to stay fun. You can set <strong>purchase\nlimits</strong>, take a <strong>break</strong>, or\n<strong>self-exclude</strong> from the Platform from your account\nsettings or by contacting Support. We may also apply limits or close an\naccount where we have concerns about a user’s wellbeing. MistyBox is for\nadults only and is never marketed to minors. See our <a\nhref=\"responsible-purchasing\">Responsible Purchasing</a> policy.</p>\n<h2 id=\"prohibited-conduct\">13. Prohibited conduct</h2>\n<p>You must not:</p>\n<ul>\n<li>create multiple accounts, or use another person’s account or payment\nmethod;</li>\n<li>use bots, scripts, exploits or automation, or interfere with the\nProvably Fair system or the Platform’s security;</li>\n<li>hide your location or identity;</li>\n<li>abuse promotions, make fraudulent deposits or chargebacks, or\nlaunder money;</li>\n<li>resell access to the Platform or use it for any unlawful purpose;\nor</li>\n<li>harass our staff or other users.</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"suspension-and-closure\">14. Suspension and closure</h2>\n<p>We may suspend, restrict or close your account, cancel pending\nactions, and withhold promotional value or amounts obtained in breach of\nthese Terms if:</p>\n<ul>\n<li>we reasonably believe you have breached these Terms or the law;</li>\n<li>you are located in a restricted state; or</li>\n<li>we are required to do so by law or a payment partner.</li>\n</ul>\n<p>Where the law permits, we will pay out any withdrawable balance you\nare legitimately entitled to. You may close your account at any time by\ncontacting Support.</p>\n<h2 id=\"intellectual-property\">15. Intellectual property</h2>\n<p>The Platform and all of its content, including the MistyBox name,\nlogos, designs, software and animations, belong to Rocket Dreams or its\nlicensors. You receive a limited, personal, non-transferable license to\nuse the Platform for its intended purpose. Third-party brand names and\ntrademarks shown on items belong to their owners. Their display does not\nimply endorsement of MistyBox.</p>\n<h2 id=\"disclaimers\">16. Disclaimers</h2>\n<p>Items are sold with any manufacturer warranty described on the item\npage. <strong>Except as stated in these Terms and to the extent\npermitted by law, the Platform is provided “as is” and “as\navailable”</strong>, without warranties of any kind, including\nmerchantability, fitness for a particular purpose and non-infringement.\nFair market values are reference values from third-party retailers. They\nare not appraisals or guarantees of resale value.</p>\n<h2 id=\"limitation-of-liability\">17. Limitation of liability</h2>\n<p>To the extent permitted by law:</p>\n<ul>\n<li>we are not liable for indirect, incidental, special, consequential\nor punitive damages, or for lost profits; and</li>\n<li>our total liability for any claim relating to the Platform is\nlimited to the greater of <strong>(a)</strong> the amounts you paid us\nin the 6 months before the claim and <strong>(b)</strong> US $100.</li>\n</ul>\n<p>Some states do not allow these limitations, so they may not apply to\nyou.</p>\n<h2 id=\"indemnity\">18. Indemnity</h2>\n<p>You agree to indemnify Rocket Dreams against claims arising from your\nbreach of these Terms or your misuse of the Platform.</p>\n<h2 id=\"changes-to-these-terms\">19. Changes to these Terms</h2>\n<p>We may update these Terms from time to time. We will notify you of\nmaterial changes by email or in the app at least 14 days before they\ntake effect, except where a change is required by law. If you keep using\nthe Platform after a change takes effect, you accept the updated\nTerms.</p>\n<h2 id=\"dispute-resolution-and-arbitration\">20. Dispute resolution and\narbitration</h2>\n<p><strong>(a) Informal resolution.</strong> Before filing a claim,\ncontact support@mistybox.com and give us 30 days to try to resolve\nit.</p>\n<p><strong>(b) Binding arbitration.</strong> Any dispute that is not\nresolved informally will be resolved by <strong>binding individual\narbitration</strong> administered by the American Arbitration\nAssociation under its Consumer Arbitration Rules. The Federal\nArbitration Act governs this section. Either party may instead bring an\nindividual claim in small-claims court.</p>\n<p><strong>(c) Class action and jury waiver.</strong> <strong>You and we\neach waive the right to a jury trial and to bring or join any class,\ncollective or representative action.</strong></p>\n<p><strong>(d) Opt-out.</strong> You may opt out of this arbitration\nagreement by emailing support@mistybox.com, with the subject\n“Arbitration Opt-Out”, within <strong>30 days</strong> of first\naccepting these Terms.</p>\n<h2 id=\"governing-law\">21. Governing law</h2>\n<p>These Terms are governed by the laws of the State of\n<strong>[Delaware]</strong>, without regard to its conflict-of-law\nrules, except where the law of your state of residence requires\notherwise.</p>\n<h2 id=\"general\">22. General</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>These Terms, together with the policies they refer to, are the\nentire agreement between you and us.</li>\n<li>If any provision is found unenforceable, the remaining provisions\nstay in effect.</li>\n<li>Our failure to enforce a provision is not a waiver of it.</li>\n<li>You may not assign these Terms. We may assign them as part of a\nmerger, acquisition or sale of assets.</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"contact\">23. Contact</h2>\n<p>Rocket Dreams Inc. · 39555 Orchard Hill Place, STE 600, Novi, MI\n48375, USA · <strong>support@mistybox.com</strong></p>\n"}, "privacy-policy": {"t": "Privacy Policy", "h": "<p><em>Last updated: November 25, 2026</em></p>\n<p>This Privacy Policy explains how <strong>Rocket Dreams Inc.</strong>,\n39555 Orchard Hill Place, STE 600, Novi, MI 48375, USA\n(“<strong>we</strong>”, “<strong>us</strong>”), collects, uses and\nshares personal information when you use MistyBox: our website at\nwww.mistybox.com, our iOS and Android apps, and related services (the\n“<strong>Platform</strong>”). It forms part of our <a\nhref=\"terms-of-service\">Terms of Service</a>.</p>\n<h2 id=\"information-we-collect\">1. Information we collect</h2>\n<table>\n<colgroup>\n<col style=\"width: 33%\" />\n<col style=\"width: 33%\" />\n<col style=\"width: 33%\" />\n</colgroup>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>Category</th>\n<th>Examples</th>\n<th>Source</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>Account and identifiers</strong></td>\n<td>name, email address, social sign-in ID (Apple, Google or Facebook),\naccount ID</td>\n<td>you; your sign-in provider</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>Age and identity verification</strong></td>\n<td>date of birth, government ID images, selfie or liveness check,\nverification result</td>\n<td>you; our verification provider (Sumsub)</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>Contact and shipping</strong></td>\n<td>shipping address, phone number (if provided)</td>\n<td>you</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>Transaction data</strong></td>\n<td>deposits, box openings, items, Gift Coins, Sell-backs, withdrawals,\nshipments</td>\n<td>the Platform</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>Payment data</strong></td>\n<td>card type, last four digits, payment tokens, payment status. We do\nnot store full card numbers.</td>\n<td>you; our payment processors</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>Geolocation</strong></td>\n<td>precise or approximate device location, IP address</td>\n<td>your device</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>Device and usage</strong></td>\n<td>device type, operating system, app version, IP address, browser,\npages and features used, crash logs, cookies and similar\nidentifiers</td>\n<td>your device; analytics providers</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>Communications</strong></td>\n<td>support emails, survey responses, marketing preferences</td>\n<td>you</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>Fraud and compliance</strong></td>\n<td>risk scores, AML screening results, chargeback history</td>\n<td>our service providers</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<p><strong>Sensitive personal information.</strong> Government ID\nimages, biometric data used for liveness checks, and precise geolocation\nare sensitive personal information. We use them <strong>only</strong> to\nverify your age and identity, to confirm you are in a location where\nMistyBox is available, to prevent fraud, and to meet our legal\nobligations.</p>\n<h2 id=\"how-we-use-your-information\">2. How we use your information</h2>\n<p>We use personal information to:</p>\n<ul>\n<li>create and run your account, process deposits, box openings,\nSell-backs, withdrawals and shipments;</li>\n<li>verify your age, identity and location, and enforce our\none-account-per-person rule and state restrictions;</li>\n<li>run our Provably Fair system and keep records of results;</li>\n<li>prevent fraud, money laundering, promotion abuse and chargebacks,\nand meet our legal, tax and regulatory obligations;</li>\n<li>provide customer support and send service messages, such as Vault\nreminders and shipping updates;</li>\n<li>support responsible purchasing, including purchase limits and\nself-exclusion;</li>\n<li>improve and secure the Platform, and analyze how it is used;</li>\n<li>send marketing, with your consent where required, which you can opt\nout of at any time; and</li>\n<li>enforce our Terms and defend legal claims.</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"how-we-share-information\">3. How we share information</h2>\n<p>We <strong>do not sell</strong> your personal information for money.\nWe share it with:</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Service providers</strong> that work on our behalf: payment\nprocessors and card networks, identity verification (Sumsub),\ngeolocation, cloud hosting, customer support, email, analytics, and\nshipping carriers and fulfillment partners.</li>\n<li><strong>Third-party vendors</strong> that supply and ship items to\nyou. They receive only your name, shipping address and order\ndetails.</li>\n<li><strong>Sign-in providers</strong> (Apple, Google, Facebook), when\nyou choose to sign in through them.</li>\n<li><strong>Advertising partners</strong>, such as Meta and Google,\nwhich use cookies, pixels and similar tools to measure campaigns and\nshow you relevant ads. Under some state laws this may count as “sharing”\nor “targeted advertising”. You can opt out (section 6).</li>\n<li><strong>Authorities, regulators and payment partners</strong>, where\nrequired by law or to protect rights, safety and the integrity of the\nPlatform.</li>\n<li><strong>A buyer or successor</strong>, as part of a merger,\nacquisition or sale of assets.</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"cookies-and-tracking\">4. Cookies and tracking</h2>\n<p>See our <a href=\"cookie-policy\">Cookie Policy</a> for details. We use\ncookies, SDKs and similar technologies to keep you signed in, remember\nyour preferences, secure the Platform, and for analytics and\nadvertising. You can manage them in your browser or device settings and\nthrough our cookie preferences tool. We honor <strong>Global Privacy\nControl</strong> browser signals as an opt-out of sharing and targeted\nadvertising.</p>\n<h2 id=\"retention\">5. Retention</h2>\n<p>We keep personal information for as long as your account is open and\nafterwards as needed for the purposes above. This includes <strong>at\nleast 5 years</strong> after account closure for transaction,\nidentity-verification and AML records, where the law requires it.\nSelf-exclusion records are kept so that we can enforce the\nexclusion.</p>\n<h2 id=\"your-privacy-rights\">6. Your privacy rights</h2>\n<p>Depending on your state of residence (for example California,\nColorado, Connecticut, Virginia, Texas, Oregon and others), you may have\nthe right to:</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>know and access</strong> the personal information we hold\nabout you;</li>\n<li><strong>correct</strong> inaccurate information;</li>\n<li><strong>delete</strong> your information, subject to legal\nexceptions such as AML record-keeping;</li>\n<li><strong>get a copy</strong> of your information in a portable\nformat;</li>\n<li><strong>opt out</strong> of the sale or sharing of your personal\ninformation, targeted advertising and profiling;</li>\n<li><strong>limit</strong> our use of sensitive personal information;\nand</li>\n<li><strong>appeal</strong> if we deny your request.</li>\n</ul>\n<p>To exercise these rights, email <strong>privacy@mistybox.com</strong>\nor use <strong>Account → Privacy</strong> in the app. We will verify\nyour identity before acting on a request. You may use an authorized\nagent. We will not discriminate against you for exercising your\nrights.</p>\n<p><strong>California residents:</strong> in the last 12 months we\ncollected the categories listed in section 1 for the purposes in section\n2, and we disclosed them to the recipients in section 3. We have not\nsold personal information. We may “share” identifiers and device or\nusage data with advertising partners for cross-context behavioral\nadvertising. To opt out, use the <strong>“Your Privacy Choices”</strong>\nlink in the site footer.</p>\n<h2 id=\"security\">7. Security</h2>\n<p>We use administrative, technical and physical safeguards, such as\nencryption in transit, access controls and vendor due diligence. No\nsystem is completely secure. Please keep your login safe.</p>\n<h2 id=\"children\">8. Children</h2>\n<p>MistyBox is <strong>only for adults (18+)</strong> and is never\nmarketed to minors. We exclude under-18 audiences from our advertising\nand do not knowingly collect information from anyone under 18. If we\nlearn that we have, we will delete it and close the account.</p>\n<h2 id=\"location-of-processing\">9. Location of processing</h2>\n<p>The Platform is for users in the United States. Your information may\nbe processed in the United States and in other countries where our\nservice providers operate, with appropriate safeguards in place.</p>\n<h2 id=\"changes\">10. Changes</h2>\n<p>We may update this policy. We will notify you of material changes by\nemail or in the app.</p>\n<h2 id=\"contact\">11. Contact</h2>\n<p>Rocket Dreams Inc. · 39555 Orchard Hill Place, STE 600, Novi, MI\n48375, USA · <strong>privacy@mistybox.com</strong></p>\n"}, "cookie-policy": {"t": "Cookie Policy", "h": "<p><em>Last updated: November 25, 2026</em></p>\n<p>This Cookie Policy explains how <strong>Rocket Dreams Inc.</strong>\n(“<strong>we</strong>”, “<strong>us</strong>”) uses cookies and similar\ntechnologies on the MistyBox website and apps (the\n“<strong>Platform</strong>”). It forms part of our <a\nhref=\"privacy-policy\">Privacy Policy</a>.</p>\n<h2 id=\"what-cookies-are\">1. What cookies are</h2>\n<p>Cookies are small text files stored on your device when you visit a\nwebsite. Apps use similar technologies, such as software development\nkits (SDKs), device identifiers and local storage. In this policy we\ncall all of them “<strong>cookies</strong>”.</p>\n<h2 id=\"the-cookies-we-use\">2. The cookies we use</h2>\n<table>\n<colgroup>\n<col style=\"width: 33%\" />\n<col style=\"width: 33%\" />\n<col style=\"width: 33%\" />\n</colgroup>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>Type</th>\n<th>What they do</th>\n<th>Can you turn them off?</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>Strictly necessary</strong></td>\n<td>Keep you signed in, secure your account, remember your cookie\nchoices, check your location for availability, prevent fraud and process\npayments.</td>\n<td>No. The Platform cannot work without them.</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>Preferences</strong></td>\n<td>Remember settings such as sound, language and display options.</td>\n<td>Yes</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>Analytics</strong></td>\n<td>Help us understand how the Platform is used, find errors and improve\nit.</td>\n<td>Yes</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>Advertising</strong></td>\n<td>Measure our ad campaigns and show you relevant MistyBox ads on other\nsites and apps (for example Meta and Google). Under some state laws this\nmay count as “sharing” or “targeted advertising”.</td>\n<td>Yes</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<p>We exclude users under 18 from advertising audiences and never use\ncookies to target minors.</p>\n<h2 id=\"your-choices\">3. Your choices</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Cookie preferences.</strong> Use the <strong>Cookie\nsettings</strong> link in the site footer, or <strong>Account →\nPrivacy</strong> in the app, to accept or reject each optional category.\nNon-essential cookies stay off until you choose.</li>\n<li><strong>Global Privacy Control.</strong> We honor GPC browser\nsignals as an opt-out of sharing and targeted advertising.</li>\n<li><strong>Your browser or device.</strong> You can block or delete\ncookies in your browser settings, and limit ad tracking in your phone’s\nprivacy settings (for example “Ask App Not to Track” on iOS).</li>\n<li><strong>Industry opt-outs.</strong> You can also opt out of\ninterest-based ads at optout.aboutads.info and youradchoices.com.</li>\n</ul>\n<p>Blocking strictly necessary cookies may stop parts of the Platform\nfrom working.</p>\n<h2 id=\"how-long-cookies-last\">4. How long cookies last</h2>\n<p>Session cookies are deleted when you close your browser. Persistent\ncookies stay for a set period, usually between 30 days and 13 months,\nunless you delete them sooner.</p>\n<h2 id=\"changes\">5. Changes</h2>\n<p>We may update this policy when we change the cookies we use. The date\nat the top shows when it was last updated.</p>\n<h2 id=\"contact\">6. Contact</h2>\n<p>Rocket Dreams Inc. · 39555 Orchard Hill Place, STE 600, Novi, MI\n48375, USA · <strong>privacy@mistybox.com</strong></p>\n"}, "refunds-sell-back": {"t": "Refunds & Sell-back", "h": "<p><em>Last updated: November 25, 2026</em></p>\n<p>This policy explains how deposits, refunds, Sell-back and withdrawals\nwork on MistyBox. It forms part of our <a href=\"terms-of-service\">Terms\nof Service</a>. MistyBox is operated by Rocket Dreams\nInc. (“<strong>we</strong>”, “<strong>us</strong>”).</p>\n<h2 id=\"your-balance\">1. Your balance</h2>\n<p>Deposits are made in U.S. dollars by debit or credit card and are\nheld as your account balance. You use your balance to open boxes.</p>\n<h2 id=\"refund-of-a-deposit-before-your-first-box\">2. Refund of a\ndeposit before your first box</h2>\n<p>If you have deposited funds but <strong>have not opened any\nbox</strong>, you may ask for a full refund of your deposit. The refund\ngoes back to the payment method you used to deposit.</p>\n<p>Once you have opened a box (other than a promotional bonus box),\nunspent deposit funds <strong>can no longer be refunded or\nwithdrawn</strong>. They stay in your balance for opening boxes.</p>\n<h2 id=\"sell-back-buyback\">3. Sell-back (Buyback)</h2>\n<p>After you reveal an item, you may sell it back to us instead of\nhaving it shipped.</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Amount:</strong> we credit your balance with <strong>90% of\nthe item’s fair market value</strong>, as displayed when you opened the\nbox.</li>\n<li><strong>Processing fee:</strong> the remaining <strong>10%</strong>\nis kept by us as a processing fee.</li>\n<li><strong>Timing:</strong> the credit is added to your balance\nimmediately.</li>\n<li><strong>Sell-back is final.</strong> Once an item is sold back, it\ncannot be reclaimed.</li>\n</ul>\n<p>Sell-back applies to the <strong>physical item only</strong>. Gift\nCoins you received at the reveal are never bought back, refunded or\nreversed.</p>\n<h2 id=\"automatic-sell-back-after-7-days\">4. Automatic Sell-back after 7\ndays</h2>\n<p>Items you do not ship or sell stay in your <strong>Vault</strong> for\n<strong>7 days (168 hours)</strong> from the reveal. We send you in-app\nreminders before the deadline. When the 7 days end, the item is\n<strong>automatically sold back</strong> on the terms in section 3, and\nthe amount is credited to your balance. The time remaining is shown on\neach item in your Vault.</p>\n<h2 id=\"items-we-cannot-supply\">5. Items we cannot supply</h2>\n<p>If an item you choose to ship is unavailable when you claim it, or\ncannot be shipped within 14 business days (for example because it is out\nof stock), we return it to inventory and credit your balance with\n<strong>100% of the item’s fair market value</strong>. You may withdraw\nthis amount or use it on MistyBox.</p>\n<h2 id=\"what-you-can-withdraw\">6. What you can withdraw</h2>\n<p>You may withdraw:</p>\n<ul>\n<li>proceeds from a Sell-back (manual or automatic), and</li>\n<li>amounts credited because an item could not be supplied (section\n5).</li>\n</ul>\n<p>You may <strong>not</strong> withdraw unspent deposits after you have\nopened a box, Gift Coins, or promotional account credit.</p>\n<p><strong>How withdrawals are paid:</strong> to your original payment\nmethod by default. You can ask for a different payment method, subject\nto identity (KYC) and anti-money-laundering (AML) checks through our\nverification provider, Sumsub.</p>\n<h2 id=\"identity-checks-and-holds\">7. Identity checks and holds</h2>\n<p>Refunds and withdrawals above the thresholds in our AML policy\nrequire identity verification. We may delay or freeze funds while we\nreview an account where we suspect fraud, abuse, multiple accounts,\nchargebacks or a breach of our Terms of Service.</p>\n<h2 id=\"gift-coins\">8. Gift Coins</h2>\n<p>Gift Coins are non-refundable loyalty rewards with no cash value.\nThey cannot be withdrawn, transferred, sold or converted to cash or\ncryptocurrency. Products bought in the MistyBox Store with Gift Coins\nare returned as Gift Coins, not cash.</p>\n<h2 id=\"promotional-bonus-box-and-credit\">9. Promotional bonus box and\ncredit</h2>\n<p>If you receive a first-deposit bonus box, its item can be shipped,\nsold back or held in your Vault like any other item. However,\n<strong>you may not withdraw Sell-back proceeds from a bonus box until\nyou have opened at least one box using your own deposited\nfunds.</strong> Promotional account credit can only be used to open\nboxes. It cannot be withdrawn or redeemed for cash. Bonus boxes do not\nearn Gift Coins.</p>\n<h2 id=\"damaged-or-incorrect-items\">10. Damaged or incorrect items</h2>\n<p>If a shipped item arrives damaged or is not the item shown in your\nVault, contact <a href=\"support\">Support</a> within <strong>7 days of\ndelivery</strong> with photos. We will arrange a replacement, a return,\nor a credit of the item’s fair market value to your balance.</p>\n<h2 id=\"chargebacks\">11. Chargebacks</h2>\n<p>Please contact Support before disputing a charge with your bank. If\nyou file a chargeback for a deposit you have used, we may suspend your\naccount while the dispute is resolved.</p>\n<h2 id=\"contact\">12. Contact</h2>\n<p>Questions? Email <strong>support@mistybox.com</strong>.</p>\n"}, "shipping-delivery": {"t": "Shipping & Delivery", "h": "<p><em>Last updated: November 25, 2026</em></p>\n<p>This policy forms part of our <a href=\"terms-of-service\">Terms of\nService</a>.</p>\n<h2 id=\"where-we-ship\">1. Where we ship</h2>\n<p>We ship to street addresses in the United States, in the states where\nMistyBox is available. We do not ship to P.O. boxes or outside the\nUnited States. See <a href=\"terms-of-service#eligibility\">Who can use\nMistyBox</a>.</p>\n<h2 id=\"requesting-shipment\">2. Requesting shipment</h2>\n<p>Open your <strong>Vault</strong>, select the item and choose\n<strong>Ship</strong>. Enter your full name and shipping address, check\nthe shipping fee, and confirm. You must request shipment within\n<strong>7 days</strong> of the reveal. After that, unclaimed items are\nautomatically sold back (see <a href=\"refunds-sell-back\">Refunds &amp;\nSell-back</a>).</p>\n<p>Please check your address carefully. We are not responsible for\ndelays or losses caused by an incorrect address.</p>\n<h2 id=\"shipping-fees\">3. Shipping fees</h2>\n<p>You pay a reasonable shipping fee based on what shipping costs us.\nThe exact fee is <strong>shown before you confirm</strong> and depends\non the item and destination. You can pay it from your account\nbalance.</p>\n<h2 id=\"when-your-item-ships\">4. When your item ships</h2>\n<p>All claimed items ship within <strong>14 business days</strong> of\nyour shipping request. You will get an email with a tracking number when\nyour item ships.</p>\n<p>If we cannot ship an item within 14 business days (for example\nbecause it is out of stock), we return it to inventory and credit your\nbalance with <strong>100% of its fair market value</strong>. You may\nwithdraw this amount or use it on MistyBox.</p>\n<h2 id=\"insurance-signature-and-packaging\">5. Insurance, signature and\npackaging</h2>\n<p>Shipments are fully insured until they are delivered. High-value\nitems may require an <strong>adult signature</strong> on delivery. Items\nship in discreet, secure packaging.</p>\n<h2 id=\"partner-fulfilled-items\">6. Partner-fulfilled items</h2>\n<p>Some items are supplied and shipped directly by trusted third-party\nvendors. The same 14-business-day timeline and protections apply. Your\nitem may arrive in the vendor’s packaging.</p>\n<h2 id=\"identity-verification\">7. Identity verification</h2>\n<p>Shipments above the value thresholds in our anti-money-laundering\n(AML) policy require identity verification before dispatch. If we need\ndocuments from you, we will ask in the app, and the 14-day period starts\nonce verification is complete.</p>\n<h2 id=\"authenticity\">8. Authenticity</h2>\n<p>Every item is genuine. Items are new unless the item page says\notherwise. They ship with the documentation listed on the item page,\nsuch as the box, papers or warranty card.</p>\n<h2 id=\"lost-damaged-or-incorrect-shipments\">9. Lost, damaged or\nincorrect shipments</h2>\n<p>If tracking shows no movement for 10 business days, or your item\narrives damaged or is not the item shown in your Vault, contact\n<strong>support@mistybox.com</strong> within <strong>7 days of\ndelivery</strong> (or of the expected delivery date). Include photos\nwhere relevant. We will file the insurance claim and send a replacement\nor credit your balance with the item’s fair market value.</p>\n<h2 id=\"taxes\">10. Taxes</h2>\n<p>Applicable sales tax is shown at checkout where required.</p>\n<h2 id=\"contact\">11. Contact</h2>\n<p><strong>support@mistybox.com</strong></p>\n"}, "fairness": {"t": "Item Values & Provably Fair", "h": "<p><em>Last updated: November 25, 2026</em></p>\n<p>This page explains how we set item values, how the item you receive\nis selected, and how you can check every result yourself. It forms part\nof our <a href=\"terms-of-service\">Terms of Service</a>.</p>\n<h2 id=\"what-you-see-before-you-open-a-box\">1. What you see before you\nopen a box</h2>\n<p>Before you confirm any purchase, each box shows:</p>\n<ul>\n<li>the <strong>box price</strong>;</li>\n<li><strong>every item</strong> the box can contain;</li>\n<li>each item’s <strong>fair market value</strong>; and</li>\n<li>the <strong>probability (odds)</strong> of receiving each item,\nshown as a percentage. The probabilities of all items in a box add up to\n100%.</li>\n</ul>\n<p>Every box contains one of the items shown. <strong>No box is ever\nempty.</strong></p>\n<h2 id=\"rarity-tiers\">2. Rarity tiers</h2>\n<p>Items in each box are grouped into five rarity tiers of similar\nvalue: <strong>Common, Uncommon, Rare, Epic and Legendary</strong>.\nCommon is the lowest-value tier and Legendary the highest. Higher-value\ntiers generally have lower probabilities, and lower-value tiers have\nhigher probabilities.</p>\n<p>When you open a box, the result first determines the\n<strong>tier</strong>, and then one item <strong>within that\ntier</strong> is selected at random. The probability shown next to each\nitem already combines both steps.</p>\n<h2 id=\"how-fair-market-values-are-set\">3. How fair market values are\nset</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Each item’s fair market value is taken from <strong>independent\nthird-party retail websites</strong>.</li>\n<li>For every item we record the listed price and store the source\nURL.</li>\n<li>Values are <strong>updated automatically</strong> as retail prices\nchange, so the value shown on a box may change between visits.</li>\n<li>The value shown <strong>at the moment you open the box</strong> is\nlocked in for that item. It is used for Gift Coins, Sell-back and any\ncredit for an item we cannot supply.</li>\n<li>Fair market values are reference values. They are not appraisals or\nguarantees of what you could resell an item for elsewhere.</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"the-full-value-guarantee\">4. The full-value guarantee</h2>\n<p>If the item you receive has a fair market value <strong>lower than\nthe price you paid</strong>, we immediately credit <strong>Gift\nCoins</strong> equal to the difference. One Gift Coin is equivalent to\nUS $1.00 in the MistyBox Store.</p>\n<blockquote>\n<p><strong>Example:</strong> you open a $100 box and receive a watch\nvalued at $60. You receive the watch <strong>plus 40 Gift\nCoins</strong>, for a total value of $100.</p>\n</blockquote>\n<p>If the item is worth the box price or more, you receive the item\nonly. Promotional bonus boxes do not earn Gift Coins.</p>\n<h2 id=\"provably-fair\">5. Provably Fair</h2>\n<p>Results are generated by a cryptographic <strong>Provably\nFair</strong> system that is random, unbiased and independently\nverifiable.</p>\n<p><strong>The result is locked in before anything appears on\nscreen.</strong> The opening animation is for display only. It does not\ndecide or influence the result, and you can skip it at any time.</p>\n<p>For every opening we give you:</p>\n<table>\n<colgroup>\n<col style=\"width: 50%\" />\n<col style=\"width: 50%\" />\n</colgroup>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>Value</th>\n<th>What it is</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>Server seed hash</strong></td>\n<td>A cryptographic fingerprint of our secret server seed, shown\n<strong>before</strong> you open the box, so we cannot change the seed\nafterwards.</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>Client seed</strong></td>\n<td>A value from your side that we cannot control. You can change it at\nany time in <strong>Account → Fairness</strong>.</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>Nonce</strong></td>\n<td>A counter that increases by one with every opening that uses the\nsame seeds.</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>Server seed</strong></td>\n<td>Revealed <strong>after</strong> the purchase, so you can confirm it\nmatches the hash you saw beforehand.</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<h2 id=\"how-to-verify-a-result\">6. How to verify a result</h2>\n<ol type=\"1\">\n<li>Open any result from <strong>Account → History</strong>, or from the\nresult screen straight after the reveal.</li>\n<li>Tap <strong>Verify</strong>. Our tool recalculates the result from\nthe server seed, client seed and nonce and shows you the tier and item\nit produces.</li>\n<li>You can also check the result independently: hash the revealed\nserver seed with SHA-256 and confirm it matches the hash shown before\nthe opening, then apply the published algorithm to the seeds and\nnonce.</li>\n</ol>\n<p>The full algorithm, including how the combined value is mapped to a\ntier and an item, is published on the verification page so that anyone\ncan reproduce it.</p>\n<h2 id=\"questions\">7. Questions</h2>\n<p>If a result does not verify, or you have any question about values or\nprobabilities, email <strong>support@mistybox.com</strong> with the\nopening ID and we will investigate.</p>\n"}, "responsible-purchasing": {"t": "Responsible Purchasing", "h": "<p><em>Last updated: November 25, 2026</em></p>\n<p>MistyBox is an online store for authentic luxury watches and other\npremium goods, sold through a mystery-box experience. It is meant to be\na fun way to shop, never a way to make money or solve financial\nproblems. This policy explains the tools we give you to stay in control\nand the commitments we make. It forms part of our <a\nhref=\"terms-of-service\">Terms of Service</a>.</p>\n<h2 id=\"our-commitments\">1. Our commitments</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Adults only.</strong> MistyBox is only for people aged\n<strong>18 or over</strong>, or the age of majority where they live if\nthat is higher. We verify age before the first deposit and may ask for\nproof of age or identity at any time.</li>\n<li><strong>No marketing to minors.</strong> We do not design, place or\ntarget advertising at people under 18. We do not use influencers or\ncontent aimed primarily at minors, and we exclude under-18 audiences on\nevery advertising platform we use.</li>\n<li><strong>Full transparency before you buy.</strong> Every box shows\nits price, every item it can contain, each item’s fair market value and\nthe probability of receiving each item, before you open it. See <a\nhref=\"fairness\">Item Values, Probabilities &amp; Provably Fair</a>.</li>\n<li><strong>Full value for every box.</strong> If the item you receive\nis worth less than the box price, we add Gift Coins for the difference,\nso every opening is worth at least what you paid.</li>\n<li><strong>Clear costs.</strong> Shipping fees and the 10% Sell-back\nprocessing fee are shown before you confirm.</li>\n<li><strong>No pressure.</strong> We do not offer credit, do not let you\nopen boxes on borrowed money from us, and the reveal animation can\nalways be skipped.</li>\n<li><strong>Trained team.</strong> Our support team is trained to\nrecognize signs that a customer may be spending more than they can\nafford, and to offer the tools below.</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"tools-you-control\">2. Tools you control</h2>\n<p>You can use these tools at any time in <strong>Account →\nLimits</strong>, or by emailing\n<strong>support@mistybox.com</strong>.</p>\n<table>\n<colgroup>\n<col style=\"width: 50%\" />\n<col style=\"width: 50%\" />\n</colgroup>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>Tool</th>\n<th>How it works</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>Deposit limits</strong></td>\n<td>Set a daily, weekly and/or monthly limit on how much you can add to\nyour balance. Lower limits apply immediately. Higher limits, or removing\na limit, take effect after <strong>24 hours</strong>.</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>Purchase limits</strong></td>\n<td>Set a daily, weekly and/or monthly limit on how much you spend on\nboxes. Same rules as deposit limits.</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>Session reminders</strong></td>\n<td>Get a reminder after a chosen amount of time on the Platform, with a\nsummary of your activity.</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>Activity history</strong></td>\n<td>See all your deposits, openings, Sell-backs, shipments and\nwithdrawals in <strong>Account → History</strong>.</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>Take a break</strong></td>\n<td>Pause your account for <strong>24 hours, 7 days or 30 days</strong>.\nDuring a break you cannot deposit or open boxes. You can still ship or\nsell items already in your Vault.</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>Self-exclusion</strong></td>\n<td>Close your account for <strong>6 months, 1 year or\npermanently</strong>. This cannot be reversed before the period\nends.</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<h2 id=\"what-happens-when-you-self-exclude\">3. What happens when you\nself-exclude</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>You cannot log in, deposit or open boxes, and we will not let you\nopen a new account.</li>\n<li>Items in your Vault are automatically sold back on our usual\nSell-back terms, unless you ask us to ship them within 7 days.</li>\n<li>Any balance you are entitled to withdraw is paid out to your\noriginal payment method, subject to our usual checks.</li>\n<li>We stop all marketing to you, including email, push notifications\nand, where we can, advertising audiences.</li>\n<li>At the end of a fixed period, your account stays closed until you\nask to reopen it. We then apply a <strong>7-day cooling-off\nperiod</strong> before you can deposit again.</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"signs-it-may-be-time-to-take-a-break\">4. Signs it may be time to\ntake a break</h2>\n<p>Consider using the tools above, or talking to someone, if you:</p>\n<ul>\n<li>spend more than you planned, or more than you can comfortably\nafford;</li>\n<li>open boxes to try to make up for an earlier result;</li>\n<li>borrow money or skip bills to make purchases;</li>\n<li>feel anxious, irritable or guilty about your spending; or</li>\n<li>hide your spending from people close to you.</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"our-own-checks\">5. Our own checks</h2>\n<p>We may contact you, apply limits, pause or close an account where we\nsee signs of harmful spending, where we suspect a user is under 18, or\nwhere a family member raises a credible concern. We do this to protect\nyou, and we will explain what we have done.</p>\n<h2 id=\"protecting-minors\">6. Protecting minors</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Keep your login details private and do not let anyone under 18 use\nyour device while signed in.</li>\n<li>Parental control tools such as Apple Screen Time, Google Family\nLink, Bark and Qustodio can block apps and sites like ours.</li>\n<li>If you believe someone under 18 is using MistyBox, email\n<strong>support@mistybox.com</strong> and we will investigate and close\nthe account.</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"where-to-get-help\">7. Where to get help</h2>\n<p>Free and confidential support is available 24/7:</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>National Council on Problem Gambling Helpline:</strong> call\nor text <strong>1-800-GAMBLER</strong>, or chat at ncpgambling.org. The\nhelpline also supports people struggling with compulsive spending and\nloot-box-style purchases.</li>\n<li><strong>988 Suicide &amp; Crisis Lifeline:</strong> call or text\n<strong>988</strong> if you are in crisis.</li>\n<li><strong>Debtors Anonymous:</strong> debtorsanonymous.org.</li>\n<li><strong>National Foundation for Credit Counseling:</strong>\nnfcc.org, or call 1-800-388-2227, for free or low-cost help with\ndebt.</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"contact\">8. Contact</h2>\n<p>Rocket Dreams Inc. · 39555 Orchard Hill Place, STE 600, Novi, MI\n48375, USA · <strong>support@mistybox.com</strong></p>\n"}, "support": {"t": "Support", "h": "<p>We’re here to help. Email <strong>support@mistybox.com</strong> and\nwe’ll reply within <strong>one business day</strong>. Please send it\nfrom the email address on your account and include your order or item\nnumber if you have one.</p>\n<h2 id=\"frequently-asked-questions\">Frequently asked questions</h2>\n<p><strong>Is every box worth what I pay?</strong> Yes. If the item you\nreveal is worth less than the box price, we add Gift Coins for the\ndifference, so every opening is worth at least what you paid. See <a\nhref=\"how-it-works\">How It Works</a>.</p>\n<p><strong>Are the watches authentic?</strong> Yes. Every item is\ngenuine and ships fully insured. Fair market values come from\nindependent third-party retailers.</p>\n<p><strong>How do I know the results are fair?</strong> Every result is\nlocked in by our Provably Fair system before the reveal. You can check\nany opening yourself from its result screen.</p>\n<p><strong>How long do I have to decide what to do with my\nitem?</strong> 7 days. After that, the item is automatically sold back\nat 90% of its fair market value. We’ll remind you before the\ndeadline.</p>\n<p><strong>How much do I get if I sell an item back?</strong> 90% of the\nfair market value shown when you opened the box, credited to your\nbalance immediately.</p>\n<p><strong>Can I withdraw my balance?</strong> You can withdraw\nSell-back proceeds and any credits for items we couldn’t supply. Unspent\ndeposits can be refunded only if you haven’t opened a box yet. See <a\nhref=\"refunds-sell-back\">Refunds &amp; Sell-back</a>.</p>\n<p><strong>What are Gift Coins?</strong> Loyalty rewards you can spend\nin the MistyBox Store. They can’t be bought, used to open boxes, or\nexchanged for cash.</p>\n<p><strong>When will my item arrive?</strong> Items ship within 14\nbusiness days, and you’ll get a tracking number by email. See <a\nhref=\"shipping-delivery\">Shipping &amp; Delivery</a>.</p>\n<p><strong>Why can’t I use MistyBox where I am?</strong> MistyBox is\nonly available in certain U.S. states. We use your device location to\ncheck this. See <a href=\"terms-of-service#eligibility\">Who can use\nMistyBox</a>.</p>\n<p><strong>Why do you need my ID?</strong> We verify age before your\nfirst deposit. We also verify identity for some withdrawals and\nshipments, as required by law and by our anti-money-laundering\npolicy.</p>\n<h2 id=\"account-and-security\">Account and security</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Close your account:</strong> email us from your account\nemail. Any balance you’re entitled to withdraw will be paid out\nfirst.</li>\n<li><strong>Delete your data:</strong> see our <a\nhref=\"privacy-policy\">Privacy Policy</a>.</li>\n<li><strong>Report suspicious activity:</strong> email\nsupport@mistybox.com with “Security” in the subject line.</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"responsible-purchasing\">Responsible purchasing</h2>\n<p>MistyBox is meant to be fun. Please spend only what you can\ncomfortably afford.</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Purchase limits:</strong> set daily, weekly or monthly\ndeposit limits in <strong>Account → Limits</strong>. Lower limits apply\nimmediately. Higher limits take effect after 24 hours.</li>\n<li><strong>Take a break:</strong> pause your account for 24 hours, 7\ndays or 30 days.</li>\n<li><strong>Self-exclusion:</strong> close your account for 6 months, 1\nyear or permanently. While you are excluded you cannot log in, deposit\nor open boxes, and we will stop sending you marketing.</li>\n</ul>\n<p>Full details are in our <a href=\"responsible-purchasing\">Responsible\nPurchasing</a> policy. If you or someone you know needs help, free and\nconfidential support is available 24/7 from the <strong>National Council\non Problem Gambling: 1-800-GAMBLER</strong> (ncpgambling.org).</p>\n<h2 id=\"company\">Company</h2>\n<p>MistyBox is operated by <strong>Rocket Dreams Inc.</strong> 39555\nOrchard Hill Place, STE 600, Novi, MI 48375, USA</p>\n"}};
window.MB_LEGAL_ORDER=["how-it-works", "terms-of-service", "privacy-policy", "cookie-policy", "refunds-sell-back", "shipping-delivery", "fairness", "responsible-purchasing", "support"];
